# Files intentionally kept trackable:
# - README.md, start.txt, LICENSE
# - requirements.txt, requirement_linux.txt, quick_test.sh
# - rag_frontend/.env.example and other non-secret config examples
# - 实验/, 优化实验/, 论文写作/, 论文证据/ and other explanation/report files

# Experiment and report folders are intentionally publishable even when they contain csv/json/log outputs.
!实验/
!实验/**
!优化实验/
!优化实验/**
!论文写作/
!论文写作/**
!论文证据/
!论文证据/**

# But never publish nested repositories or dependency/build folders inside report folders.
**/.git/
**/.git/**
**/node_modules/
**/node_modules/**
**/__pycache__/
**/__pycache__/**
**/.venv/
**/.venv/**
**/venv/
**/venv/**
